2026-06-10 14:45:31,213 | AGENT | Legal Agent answered: As Legal Counsel for Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can confirm that our company is committed to complying with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and other relevant regulations. Our standard contractual clauses include a data processing agreement template (DPA v3.2) that ensures compliance with Article 6(1)(e) of the GDPR, which covers the performance of tasks in the public interest.

Regarding explicability of automated decisions, our AI regulatory knowledge includes expertise in the EU AI Act and awareness of prohibited AI practices. We also ensure human oversight and contractual enforcement of human validation for automated decisions, aligning with the requirement for explicit agent validation before decision automation.

However, I must flag potential legal risks related to data protection, intellectual property rights, and contractual obligations. These include:

