2026-06-10 14:49:09,803 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has a robust LLM stack with models like Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3 8B, CamemBERT, and Falcon 7B deployed in production. For the City of Belval's requirements, we can leverage our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable, ensuring data sovereignty. 

